#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:70 rust/crates/effects/ui/fun_pack.slint:107 rust/crates/effects/ui/fun_pack.slint:108
msgid "Clean up"
msgstr "Bersihkan"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:71
msgid "Over time"
msgstr "Seiring waktu"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:71
msgid "Average the parts that hold still with the frames before them to clean up a dim room, without ghosting on anything that moves."
msgstr "Rata-ratakan bagian yang tidak bergerak dengan frame sebelumnya untuk mengurangi noise di ruangan redup, tanpa menimbulkan efek ghosting pada objek yang bergerak."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:72
msgid "Dehaze"
msgstr "Dehaze"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:72
msgid "Lift the washed-out look of a dirty lens, a window behind you or a cheap camera."
msgstr "Hilangkan efek pudar akibat lensa kotor, jendela di belakang Anda, atau kamera murah."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:73
msgid "Skin smoothing"
msgstr "Penghalusan kulit"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:73
msgid "Soften skin inside the person mask without blurring eyes, brows, hair and edges."
msgstr "Haluskan kulit di dalam mask orang tanpa memburamkan mata, alis, rambut, dan tepi."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:74
msgid "Sharpen"
msgstr "Penajaman"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:74
msgid "Make edges crisper without a white outline."
msgstr "Buat tepi lebih tajam tanpa garis luar putih."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:74
msgid "Detail"
msgstr "Detail"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:75
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "Radius"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:75
msgid "Set how wide the detail Sharpen picks up is."
msgstr "Atur seberapa lebar detail yang ditangkap oleh Penajaman."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:76
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "Ambang batas"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:76
msgid "Leave detail smaller than this alone for smooth skin and walls."
msgstr "Abaikan detail yang lebih kecil dari ini agar kulit dan dinding tetap halus."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:77
msgid "Clarity"
msgstr "Kejernihan"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:77
msgid "Add contrast to the mid-sized detail so a flat picture looks less flat, or go below 0 to soften it."
msgstr "Tambahkan kontras pada detail berukuran sedang agar gambar tidak terlihat datar, atau atur di bawah 0 untuk melembutkannya."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:78
msgid "Vignette"
msgstr "Vinyet"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:78
msgid "Darken the corners, or lighten them below 0."
msgstr "Gelapkan sudut-sudut gambar, atau terangkan di bawah 0."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:78
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Sentuhan akhir"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:79 rust/crates/effects/ui/name_tag.slint:174 rust/crates/effects/ui/name_tag.slint:178 rust/crates/effects/ui/stereo.slint:191
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Ukuran"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:79
msgid "Set the size of the clear area in the middle."
msgstr "Atur ukuran area yang jelas di bagian tengah."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:80
msgid "Roundness"
msgstr "Kebundaran"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:80
msgid "Shape the vignette from the frame's own shape to a circle."
msgstr "Bentuk vinyet dari bentuk bingkai aslinya menjadi lingkaran."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:81
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Pendaran"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:81
msgid "Add a soft bloom around the bright parts, like an old lens or a diffusion filter."
msgstr "Tambahkan pendaran lembut di sekitar bagian yang terang, seperti lensa lama atau filter difusi."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:82 rust/crates/effects/ui/fun_pack.slint:180
msgid "Spread"
msgstr "Rentang"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:82
msgid "Set how far the glow reaches."
msgstr "Atur seberapa jauh jangkauan pendaran."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:83
msgid "Film grain"
msgstr "Grain film"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:83
msgid "Add grain that moves every frame and is strongest in the mid-tones, like film."
msgstr "Tambahkan grain yang bergerak di setiap frame dan paling terlihat di mid-tone, seperti film."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:84
msgid "Grain size"
msgstr "Ukuran grain"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:84
msgid "Set how coarse the film grain is."
msgstr "Atur seberapa kasar grain film."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:88
msgid "Also on the phone"
msgstr "Juga di ponsel"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:89
msgid "The Camera card has the phone's own Sharpening and Noise reduction. Using both looks worse."
msgstr "Kartu Kamera memiliki fitur Penajaman dan Pengurangan noise bawaan ponsel. Menggunakan keduanya akan membuat tampilan lebih buruk."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:364 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:472 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:535 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:535 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:548 rust/crates/effects/ui/filters.slint:38
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filter"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:365
msgid "Turn every filter off to see the picture without them."
msgstr "Nonaktifkan semua filter untuk melihat gambar tanpanya."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:473
msgid "Add photo editor filters like sharpen, clarity, dehaze, denoise, skin smoothing, vignette, glow and film grain."
msgstr "Tambahkan filter editor foto seperti penajaman, kejernihan, dehaze, denoise, penghalusan kulit, vinyet, pendaran, dan grain film."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:474
msgid "Without it there's no Filters card and the picture isn't sharpened, cleaned up or finished."
msgstr "Tanpanya, kartu Filter tidak ada dan gambar tidak dipertajam, dibersihkan, atau diberi sentuhan akhir."

