#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:57
msgid "Side by side suits a headset or a 3D screen and red and cyan suits glasses."
msgstr "Berdampingan cocok untuk headset atau layar 3D, dan merah sian cocok untuk kacamata."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:58
msgid "Slide the two pictures apart or together to change how far forward the 3D reaches."
msgstr "Geser kedua gambar saling menjauh atau mendekat untuk mengubah seberapa jauh efek 3D menonjol ke depan."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:59
msgid "Lift or lower the right picture when the phones don't sit level."
msgstr "Naikkan atau turunkan gambar kanan jika posisi ponsel tidak sejajar."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:60
msgid "Zoom in on the phone that sees the wider view (the right one over 100%, the left one under it) to make both show the same thing."
msgstr "Perbesar ponsel yang menangkap bidang pandang lebih lebar (kanan di atas 100%, kiri di bawahnya) agar keduanya menampilkan hal yang sama."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:61
msgid "Roll the right picture a little when one phone is tilted against the other."
msgstr "Putar sedikit gambar kanan jika salah satu ponsel miring terhadap yang lain."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:62
msgid "Move the right picture earlier or later in time when it moves ahead of or behind the left one."
msgstr "Geser gambar kanan lebih awal atau lebih lambat jika gerakannya mendahului atau tertinggal dari gambar kiri."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:63
msgid "Show the sliders that line the two pictures up by hand."
msgstr "Tampilkan slider untuk menyelaraskan kedua gambar secara manual."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:64
msgid "Swap which phone is the left eye and which is the right if the 3D looks inside out."
msgstr "Tukar ponsel untuk mata kiri dan mata kanan jika tampilan 3D terlihat terbalik."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:65
msgid "Even out two different phones with the same shutter, similar brightness and a colour curve that makes the right picture look like the left."
msgstr "Selaraskan dua ponsel berbeda dengan shutter yang sama, kecerahan serupa, dan kurva warna yang membuat gambar kanan terlihat seperti gambar kiri."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:66
msgid "Make both phones brighter or darker together after Match, keeping them matched."
msgstr "Jadikan kedua ponsel lebih terang atau lebih gelap bersamaan setelah Pencocokan, menjaganya tetap cocok."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/stereo_plugin.rs:67
